This music APP is intended to be simple and professional, with unlimited solfeggio practices and piano songs.

It is used for solfeggio practice by providing professional music dictation drill:
1. It includes 5 different kinds of musical notes dictation (single pitch, dual pitches, chord, interval and melody) and 4 main rhythm training (2/4, 3/4, 4/4, 3/8) for beginners in music;
2. It provides a virtual piano, you can press the keys according to which note you hear;
3. It includes 1000+ note actions and 2500 rhythm actions, can you can train yourself with it all day long.

Have fun. If you have any suggestion or problem when using this APP, please don't hesitate contacting us (nuttystudio8@gmail.com)
